Engine/OpenAI.pm:189-196 _build_whisper passes only api_key, url and a hard-coded transcription_model=>"whisper-1". Verified offline: OpenAI->new(api_key=>"k", user_agent_timeout=>7, transcription_model=>"gpt-4o-transcribe")->whisper has no user_agent_timeout (LWP default 180s applies) and transcription_model "whisper-1". The parent itself composes Transcription and honours both, so $openai->simple_transcription and $openai->whisper->simple_transcription behave differently.
Fix: forward user_agent_timeout (when has_), user_agent_agent, and transcription_model from the parent (fall back to whisper-1 only when unset); consider passing the parent user_agent. Test in t/22.
